    "text": "The reaction of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Pb</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaCl</mi></math> in water produces a precipitate that dissolves upon the addition of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math> of appropriate concentration. The dissolution of the precipitate is due to the formation of",
